  "question": "Where can I find a hotel that are within 150 kilometers and lie east of the Cabell Gallery, Lexington, VA?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-79.442099 37.785277)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-79.442099 37.785277)',4326)::geography, 150000)\nAND tourism = 'hotel'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 67.5 AND 112.5;\n",
